Subject: [RFC PATCH 24/28] hw/virtio: add virtio-msg linux bridge transport
 parent

Add the composite transport parent that wires virtio-msg to the linux
bridge backend.

Keep the patch scoped to parent creation and machine/FDT integration.

Signed-off-by: Bertrand Marquis <bertrand.marquis@arm.com>
---
 hw/arm/virt.c                                 |   3 +
 hw/core/sysbus-fdt.c                          |   2 +
 hw/virtio/meson.build                         |   6 +-
 hw/virtio/virtio-msg-linux-bridge-transport.c | 203 ++++++++++++++++++
 include/hw/virtio/virtio-msg.h                |   3 +
 5 files changed, 215 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 hw/virtio/virtio-msg-linux-bridge-transport.c

